# Raw Blandford / Timeform feed chunks (large JSON, regenerable)
data/blandford_raw/

# Raw HorseRaceBase Ratings Machine downloads are deliberately NOT ignored,
# unlike the Betfair and Blandford feeds above. Those are regenerable on
# demand; these are not. The site rate-limits the account and withheld
# downloads for six months, so the 5 MB this costs is worth far less than
# re-earning the wait. They belong in S3 with the database, and should move
# there; until then this repository is the only durable copy.

# results_report.py attaches a FileHandler at import, so merely importing it --
# which tests/test_workflow_guards.py does -- drops this in the working tree.
results_report.log
